{"text":"Hello {first_name},

This is {clinic_name}. We would like you to book a follow-up visit with us. Please try to book by {due_by}.

To set up a time, call us at {clinic_phone}. We are happy to help.

If you do not want these reminders, you can stop them here: {opt_out_link}

Thank you,
{clinic_name}"}
